    "spec": "Validate the E.164 telephone's national-number length against its country code ('+61' requires 9 national digits, '+1' requires 10). Reject with 400 when the length is wrong for the country.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nValidate the E.164 telephone's national-number length against its country code ('+61' requires 9 national digits, '+1' requires 10). Reject with 400 when the length is wrong for the country.\n"
